# Route201 — Platinum-exact layout
# Shapes derived from the Platinum layout; tiles are Emerald General/Mauville metatiles.
# Legend: T tree . grass , tall grass = path ~ water L/</> ledges F fence b flower bed
#         S sign/mailbox W walk-in exit warp; letters = building doors (@stamp)
@compiler platinum
@name Route201
@layout LAYOUT_ROUTE201
@width 64
@height 32
@primary gTileset_General
@secondary gTileset_Mauville
@connection down MAP_TWINLEAF_TOWN 0
@connection left MAP_VERITY_LAKEFRONT 8
@connection right MAP_SANDGEM_TOWN 0
@sign Route201_EventScript_SandgemSign
@sign Route201_EventScript_TrainerTips
@sign Route201_EventScript_LakeSign
@grid
